X:1
T:Praise My Soul The King Of Heaven
T:PRAISE MY SOUL
C:Music: John Goss, 1869 · Words: Henry F. Lyte, 1834
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "The Plymouth Hymnal", 1894 Hymn 219. "The Choral Hymnal", 1888 page 54.. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/lauda_anima_goss) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
M:2/4
L:1/4
Q:1/4=120
K:Eb
